    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1058-a1">

                <pb facs="1151" n="1055" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1055"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Porter to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassay of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-17"><hi rendition="#italic">February 17,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President Faure asked personal interview, in which he requested me to express his
                    warmest sympathy and profound sense of condolence to President McKinley
                    regarding the appalling catastrophe to the <hi rendition="#italic">Maine</hi>,
                    and to convey an assurance that the French people and especially the French navy
                    are deeply touched by the death of the gallant officers and men who lost their
                    lives at their post of duty.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Porter.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
